  "id": "materialism",
  "term": "materialism",
  "definition": "Materialism is the metaphysical view that everything in the universe can be explained in terms of matter and its movements or changes. In this view, even consciousness and other mental events are treated as results of physical processes, with psychical life reduced to transformations of material elements.",
